+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Singleton lock: two daemons could both believe they held the lock when one
+  started while another was releasing it, because the pidfile was unlocked
+  before it was unlinked. The pidfile is now unlinked while the lock is still
+  held, and a starting daemon verifies that the pidfile it locked is still the
+  one at the path, retrying otherwise (#1).
+
 ## [0.1.0] - 2026-09-24
 
